          "text": "                  ",
          "italic": true
        }
      ]
    },
    "description": {
      "translate": "The first is to use igloo technology to speed up curing",
      "color": "#FF2A2A",
      "extra": [
        {
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "translate": "The second is to melt the frost with your own flame",
          "color": "#FF2A2A"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "translate": "The third is to seal the four elements within a pot",
          "color": "#FF2A2A"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "translate": "The fourth is to fill your inventory, yet keep it empty",
          "color": "#FF2A2A"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "translate": "The fifth is to go everywhere at once",
          "color": "#FF2A2A"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "translate": "The sixth is to collect all the references of the silent \"Shhh...\"",
          "color": "#FF2A2A"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "translate": "The seventh is to maintain the law: sharp below, soft above – a balance that cannot be overturned",
          "color": "#FF2A2A"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "translate": "The eighth is to end the duel of the frostbitten undead riders, on the grounds of differing legs",
          "color": "#FF2A2A"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "translate": "The ninth is to chase a Cat through its nine lives without losing track",
          "color": "#FF2A2A"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "translate": "The tenth is to make a deal with a clucking trader",
          "color": "#FF2A2A"
        }
      ]
    },
